        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "Jiangyin city lies in eastern China, southern Jiangsu Province and northern Taihu Plain on Yangtze River Delta. This city  is the throat of"
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "Yangtze River, standing right at the river end and also the gate to the ocean."
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "Jiangyin has been playing an important role in military, for it is an excellent nature river port and essential transportation hub, crisscrossed  by numerous rivers and lakes. The captioned project is at the east of Huashan Road and south of the Chengjiang Street of Jiangyin City,  ten minutes walk to the city center."
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "江阴位于中国华东，江苏省南部，长江三角洲太湖平原北端。江阴地处江尾海头、长江咽喉，历代为江防要塞，是大江南北的重要交通枢纽和江河湖海 联运换装的天然良港.此項目位於花山路東,位於江阴市澄江街道之南方,距離市中心伋步行十分鈡路程. 澄星萬豪酒店距離无锡机场約40分钟車程."
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "Marriott Hotel"
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "萬豪酒店"
        },
        {
